  "cloud.sharedClientHelp": "The service warns that the shared login application rclone will stop working in {0}. Use your own login application (OAuth) for a persistent connection. Choosing Yes will try to continue with the current application; choosing No will open entering your own application ID. This is not a choice between personal and shared drives.",
  "cloud.sharedClientHelpUndated": "The service warns of the end of support for the rclone shared login application. Use your own login application (OAuth) for a persistent connection. Choosing Yes will try to continue with the current application; choosing No will open entering your own application ID. This is not a choice between personal and shared drives.",
